'''Sherwood Quarry''' is a mine located in northeastern [[Northwind]]. Once ruled by [[Duke Johnathan Sherwood]] and his family, it has now fallen to the [[Dark Iron dwarf|Dark Iron dwarves]] led by [[Overseer Bragordi]] that have expanded into the region. In addition to the upper quarry, the area also includes a mine within which the Dark Irons have put some of the local kobolds to work.

